<title>GERMANY: Merck to acquire small German lab group.</title>
<headline>Merck to acquire small German lab group.</headline>
<dateline>DARMSTADT, Germany 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals and drugs group Merck KGaA said on Thursday it planned to acquire German KMF Laborchemie Handels GmbH to expand its laboratory business.</p>
<p>KMF reported sales of over 50 million marks in 1995, mostly selling laboratory chemicals, while Merck's laboratory unit posted sales of about 1.6 billion marks in 1995.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
